# The system admin edits a section directly: the save asks for the
# password, and the reason is recorded. Uses an unheld document from the
# database copy (FAM 4.01); the seeded one is held by its request.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | verify_admin
type #login-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button[type=submit] | 
wait Proposals
click .nav-item | Sections
wait Select a manual
select .select | FAM 4.01
wait OBJECTIVES
click .icon-btn[title=Edit] | 
type #direct-edit-reason | Scratch check of the password prompt.
click button[type=submit] | Save changes
wait Save this edit to the document?
shot 40-edit-asks-password
type #confirm-destructive-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button[type=submit] | Save edit
wait Section updated
shot 41-edit-saved
errors
